+         {
+           "_key": "8beb021a7b56",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": "Dive into the essence of Egypt with our enriched Cairo Travel Guide. As the bustling capital city, "
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "9f4aad0896d5",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [
+             "7ca184ee6ace"
+           ],
+           "text": "Cairo"
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "80d3e24ecf53",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": " stands as a beacon of history, culture, and modernity. It’s not just the largest city in Egypt but a pivotal one on the African continent, and a significant urban center in the Middle East and the Arab world. With the 15th-largest metropolitan area globally, Cairo is a tapestry woven with the threads of ancient civilizations, notably showcased by the majestic Giza "
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "56822971456c",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [
+             "f6e1027a0d44"
+           ],
